            <span class="el-dropdown-icon"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l2 7h7l-5.5 4 2 7L12 16l-5.5 4 2-7L3 9h7l2-7z"/></svg></span>
            <span><strong>Lo Que Aprenderás</strong><small>Contenido y resultados</small></span>
